	(text "Drive MCU, STM32G431RBT6, LCSC C431633, LQFP-64.\nClock is the internal HSI16. DS12589 Table 42: within 1 percent from 0 to 85 C.\nNo crystal. PF0 and PF1 are open. The RTC is unused, so the IWDG keeps LSI\nand ES0431 section 2.2.3 does not apply.\nnSWBOOT0 = 0. There is no BOOT0 pin. PB8 is spare and is not a gate.\nJ10 is SWD (PA13, PA14, PB3 SWO, NRST). ES0431 section 2.2.1 says use SWD.\nJ11 is USART3 on PB10 (TX) and PB11 (RX), 3.3 V. Those pins are not in AN2606 Table 115.\nADR 0020 shares rotor-return ground, so this sheet has no isolator.\nThe connector itself, and any later isolator, are TBD.\nGates: PC6 CW, PC7 CCW, PC12 brake, PD2 ARM_EN. Not debug pins, not Table 115.\nPulldowns for those gates are on the rotor sheet.\nVREF+ is filtered +3V3 through R100. VREFBUF is still an open choice." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4ae865e6-aa28-4b2d-825e-d86920c16408"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
